      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Estates are delighted to present this charming 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom semi-detached home on the highly sought after Dodsborough Road. \r\n\r\nNo. 18 is a 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom semi detached home. The accommodation is bright and very well laid out, briefly comprises of an entrance hall, living room, kitchen and dining area, on the first floor, landing leading to three bedrooms with family bathroom and is presented in very good condition throughout. The property is approached by a off street parking to the front and benefits from a mature rear garden enclosed with block built walls.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, you are welcomed by a bright and spacious entrance hall that leads into the open-plan living and dining area. Double doors connect both rooms, creating flexibility for family living and entertaining. A solid fuel fireplace adds warmth and character, making this a cosy and inviting space, particularly during the winter months. Large windows at either end of the rooms allow an abundance of natural light to flow throughout.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none. Lucan is an established and convenient residential address, with a wealth of local amenities on its doorstep. Excellent primary and secondary schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, sporting facilities and parks are all within easy reach. The N4 is only moments away offering easy access to Dublin City, Dublin Airport, excellent public transport links are on your doorstop. \r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an enviable setting overlooking a large green area and is just a short stroll from the scenic Griffeen Valley Park. A wealth of local amenities are nearby including shops, schools, leisure facilities, swimming pool, and gym. Excellent transport links include regular bus services and a train station within approximately a 15-minute walk, providing swift and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\n20 m to L51 and L52 bus stop\r\n600 m to Tesco Lucan\r\n750 m to Lucan United F.C\r\n1.1 km to Lidl\r\n1.5 km to Super Valu\r\n1.9 km to Adamstown Train Station\r\n12km to Maynooth University via the 6w Bus\r\n16 km to Grafton Street Dublin\r\n23 km to Dublin Airport\r\nAll distances are approximate.\r\n\r\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      }
